    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/c67f67528a99c61e1dfd25bc0865d517.avif?t=1749664063\" width=616 height=419 /></span><br><br>In a world shrouded by darkness and ruled over by Eldritch monstrosities, embark on a journey to restore the last beacon of light and discover the legacy of the Light Keepers. Reclaim the unique powers of your ancestors and discover the secrets of their past as you fight your way through a large, interconnected world. Explore long lost temples, coastal cliffs, and everything in between while befriending the unique sea-inspired denizens of the land along the way. Forage for unique ingredients and discover powerful (and tasty) recipes as you embark on an epic journey filled with just the right amount of creepy, cozy and tentacles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/dc8ac7b340963b9bd69bbae252e03afb.poster.avif?t=1749664063\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/dc8ac7b340963b9bd69bbae252e03afb.webm?t=1749664063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/dc8ac7b340963b9bd69bbae252e03afb.mp4?t=1749664063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control Your Light</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>In a world covered in darkness, your soft glow is a beacon for hostility.<br></li><li>Evade enemies by controlling your glow,<br></li><li>Launch extra damaging surprise attacks and navigate otherwise impossible challenges.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/8b28ef324443113b45f9cf6e0ae4bc0c.poster.avif?t=1749664063\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/8b28ef324443113b45f9cf6e0ae4bc0c.webm?t=1749664063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/8b28ef324443113b45f9cf6e0ae4bc0c.mp4?t=1749664063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Foraging and crafting</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect and discover many unique ingredients across the land.<br></li><li>Unlock and discover powerful recipes that change the way you play and help keep you alive in a dangerous world.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/f1a5973a46bc66ee2208ffeeb71c9e08.avif?t=1749664063\" width=620 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Metroidvania style design</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Inspired by classic metroidvanias and souls-lite combat.<br></li><li>Combines non-linear exploration and crafting with unique, skill-based combat encounters and platforming challenges.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand drawn and hand animated characters and levels</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore a large variety of unique hand crafted environments.<br></li><li> Discover hidden secrets, ancient relics and strange friends and foes alike.<br></li><li> Mix a little cozy in with your sea monsters - make a home for yourself in the aptly named Pier Town.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging, precision combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Master an expanding set of combat and movement abilities to defeat ever more challenging foes.<br></li><li> Choose the playstyle that works for you by combining powerful Relics.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intricate platforming</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Utilize an array of fluid movement abilities to conquer even the most complex platforming sequences.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/8d352a020db0a42573483baf21923d27.poster.avif?t=1749664063\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/8d352a020db0a42573483baf21923d27.webm?t=1749664063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/8d352a020db0a42573483baf21923d27.mp4?t=1749664063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep, discoverable lore and mythology</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Uncover the mysteries of the past as told through items, conversations and environmental storytelling.<br></li><li> Discover the mythology that drives the world, and come face to face with its Gods.</li></ul><br><br><br>Through lands shrouded by primordial darkness and dominated by creatures of legend, will you embrace your legacy and take up the mantle of the last Light Keeper?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/81fa62c0aa890cb96a0907687f2c1d45.avif?t=1749664063\" width=616 height=228 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/c67f67528a99c61e1dfd25bc0865d517.avif?t=1749664063\" width=616 height=419 /></span><br><br>In a world shrouded by darkness and ruled over by Eldritch monstrosities, embark on a journey to restore the last beacon of light and discover the legacy of the Light Keepers. Reclaim the unique powers of your ancestors and discover the secrets of their past as you fight your way through a large, interconnected world. Explore long lost temples, coastal cliffs, and everything in between while befriending the unique sea-inspired denizens of the land along the way. Forage for unique ingredients and discover powerful (and tasty) recipes as you embark on an epic journey filled with just the right amount of creepy, cozy and tentacles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/dc8ac7b340963b9bd69bbae252e03afb.poster.avif?t=1749664063\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/dc8ac7b340963b9bd69bbae252e03afb.webm?t=1749664063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/dc8ac7b340963b9bd69bbae252e03afb.mp4?t=1749664063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control Your Light</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>In a world covered in darkness, your soft glow is a beacon for hostility.<br></li><li>Evade enemies by controlling your glow,<br></li><li>Launch extra damaging surprise attacks and navigate otherwise impossible challenges.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/8b28ef3