ming sequences.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/8d352a020db0a42573483baf21923d27.poster.avif?t=1749664063\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/8d352a020db0a42573483baf21923d27.webm?t=1749664063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/8d352a020db0a42573483baf21923d27.mp4?t=1749664063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep, discoverable lore and mythology</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Uncover the mysteries of the past as told through items, conversations and environmental storytelling.<br></li><li> Discover the mythology that drives the world, and come face to face with its Gods.</li></ul><br><br><br>Through lands shrouded by primordial darkness and dominated by creatures of legend, will you embrace your legacy and take up the mantle of the last Light Keeper?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625450/extras/81fa62c0aa890cb96a0907687f2c1d45.avif?t=1749664063\" width=616 height=228 /></span>",
